0/60 px-5 py-3 dark:bg-accent-200 text-base">Huh. Well, the term came to me=
 while making an observation that the main reason I became an articulate sp=
eaker and writer was because I discovered at a young age that words and con=
cepts as I understood and used them to think rarely had the same convention=
al meanings as other people used and understood them. When I was still a ki=
d, in my adoptive family, my Dad found--and gave me--a sign for my bedroom =
door that   read "What you think I said is not what I actually meant!" It w=
as something I struggled with as strongly and deeply as I did "gender dysph=
oria".</div></div></div></div><div data-tabster=3D"{&quot;groupper&quot;:{&=
