<div class=3D"flex w-full flex-col items-end" data-content=3D"user-message"=
 style=3D""><div class=3D"font-ligatures-none h-fit max-w-[80%] self-end wh=
itespace-pre-wrap break-words rounded-2xl bg-accent-250/60 px-5 py-3 dark:b=
g-accent-200 text-base" style=3D"">I should note that this issue extended t=
o math and physics. I have always had an intuitive understanding of the und=
erlying truths and concepts, but struggled with the way they were expressed=
--in the case of math, as an actual language--and in physics as a dialect b=
ridging Maths and English (and other languages contributing terminology). I=
 remember taking an idea of mine to a 7th grade teacher about the programma=
tic qualities of language and a way to exploit it as a model and methodolog=
y for artificial intelligence. This was back in 1983, and the teacher ackno=
wleged my work, but concluded that the technology to implement it was anywh=
ere from decades to a century away from being developed. I really wish I ha=
d saved my notes and proposal, now that it's become so relevant.</div></div=
></div></div><div data-tabster=3D"{&quot;groupper&quot;:{&quot;tabbability&=
quot;:2},&quot;focusable&quot;:{}}" class=3D"" data-content=3D"ai-message" =
