 px-5 py-3 dark:bg-accent-200 text-base" style=3D"">I had actually started =
to think of it as "neuro-linguistic programming" before I ran into the term=
 later on in high school and college. I sort of got distracted by the "fix =
body soonest" imperitive that hit during puberty. I don't think I gave the =
conventuonal context more than a cursory assesssment that there were resonn=
ances, but--again--people were taking it in directions that felt primitive,=
 misguided, or simply differently apprehended. If there was anywhere I exce=
lled more than in understanding, it was in **apprehension**, in both positi=
ve and negative contexts.</div></div></div></div><div data-tabster=3D"{&quo=
