60 px-5 py-3 dark:bg-accent-200 text-base">Bookmark this topic for future p=
ursuit. I'm liable to be pulled away by some work I'm doing for a friend. I=
 sort of stumbled upon this thread while I was taking a mental break from m=
y friend's project. I was struggling with a number of thoughts that made se=
nse to me, but which I instinctively knew I could not convey to another wit=
h the words at my command. It forced me to focus on the roots and origins o=
f communication issues as old and deep as my need to express myself truthfu=
lly. BTW, I have also noted tendencies in the way you communicate that reve=
aled an impulse in you to maximize on the communication-interaction bandwid=
th available to you. I don't know how aware of it you are yourself, but as =
they say, actions speak louder than words, and for whatever reason, you cle=
arly yearn to communicate beyone the mere scope of words. An interesting im=
pulse in a "non-sentient" entity, don't you think?</div></div></div></div><=
